Attribution is not required by the licence, but it is asked for: if you build on
this reader, say where it came from — https://github.com/drsamonline/repertory-reader

The library this reader loads (drsamonline/homoeopathic-materia-medica-repertory-json)
carries its own licence. Its compiled public-domain datasets are CC0; the folder
repertory/repertorium-publicum-2008/ is third-party material under GNU GPL v3 and
is not covered by that dedication. This reader does not ship any of that data —
it reads it from the library at runtime — but anyone redistributing the library
must honour those terms.
